* Set the defaults for precision simulations
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO
#define ENERGY -0.0025
* Define the beam characteristics
*BEAM         $ENERGY         0   -3000.0      -1.0      -1.0       1.0NEUTRON
* Define the beam characteristics
!@what.2=dT2dp(0.0007,0.0007,Mn)
*BEAM        -0.00035             13140.0       2.0         0      -1.0NEUTRON
*Neutron beam
*BEAM         -0.0005         0   13140.0       2.0         0      -1.0NEUTRON
*BEAMPOS            0         0      -0.1         0         0
*Neutron beam for debug
*BEAM          -1E-06         0         0      -1.0      -1.0       1.0NEUTRON
*BEAMPOS            0         0        33         0         0
*Proton beam
BEAM         $ENERGY         0         0      -1.0      -1.0       1.0PROTON
BEAMPOS            0         0      -0.9         0         0
LOW-PWXS                                                              ENDF-VIII0
LAM-BIAS                0.0001       LiF    PROTON                    GDECAY
LAM-BIAS                0.0001     BORON   NEUTRON                    INEALL
PHYSICS            1                                                  COALESCE
PHYSICS            3                                                  EVAPORAT
USRBIN            10   NEUTRON       -21        20        20        35neutrons
