USRBIN           -20       -20       -25       100       100       100 &
USRBIN            10    PROTON       -21        20        20        35protons
USRBIN           -20       -20       -25       100       100       100 &
USRBIN            11   NEUTRON       -23        20                  35n_RZ
USRBIN                               -30       500         1       500 &
USRBIN            11    PHOTON       -23        20                  35g_RZ
USRBIN                               -30       500         1       500 &
